  "description": "Application under Section 96A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for non-material amendments to planning permission 22/00882/FULMAJ (dated 27.07.2023) including:\n(i)\tInternal Amendments for reconfiguration of student room layouts to allow for increase in number of rooms from 769 to 782;\n(ii)\tReconfiguration of internal stairs and lifts at all levels;\n(iii)\tInternal PBSA amenity space relocated from third to nineteenth and twentieth floor levels and external amenity terraces at third and twentieth floors relocated to fourteenth and nineteenth floors; \n(iv)\tPBSA rooms omitted from twentieth floor;\n(v)\tMinor realignment of building line angle adjacent to Boundary House;\n(vi)\tOmission of Basement level -2 and increased depth to basement level -1;\n(vii)\tIntroduction of separate cycle entrances at ground floor level for PBSA and Migration Museum;\n(viii)\tInternal amendments to Migration Museum layouts;\n(ix)\tOversailing corner from fourteenth floor upwards removed and facade line amended;\n(x)\tIncrease in plant area on twentieth floor;\n(xi)\tMinor facade adjustments to reflect revised internal PBSA room configuration;\n(xii)\tBalustrade at twentieth floor omitted following amendments to amenity space;\n(xiii)\tNew balustrades incorporated at fourteenth and nineteenth floors for new terrace locations;\n(xiv)\tPosition of solid band at PBSA floor levels adjusted upwards by 115 mm to align with floor level.",
